# The crags over the shoulder: its most characteristic ground clear at noon,
# then in the fog it is for, then in the evening; then beside a standing stone.
# With the frame cost standing at noon.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_crags.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_the_crags
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:the_crags
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end crags-noon
weather fog:0.7
wait 2.0
shot fog with land:the_crags
weather clear:0
hour 18.5
wait 2.0
shot evening with land:the_crags
hour 12
near standing_stone
wait 2.5
shot stone with land:the_crags
